[engl]
{100}{}{Razlo}
{200}{}{Doctor for Shady Sands.}
{1000}{}{Predialogue installations}
{1010}{}{First dialogue}
{1020}{}{Second time}
{1030}{}{Its night}
{2000}{}{I'm Razlo. Can I help you?}
{2010}{}{I need healing.}
{2020}{}{I am quite interested into medicine myself, and this is the reason I am visiting you today. My hopes are that you could share some of your knowledge and experience with me...}
{2030}{}{Not right now, but it was nice meeting you.}
{2040}{}{Tandi has been kidnapped.}
{3000}{}{You look distraught. Are you in need of assistance?}
{3010}{}{I need healing.}
{3020}{}{Nevermind.}
{4000}{}{Hello, again. How can I be of service?}
{4010}{}{Tell me about...}
{4020}{}{I need healing.}
{4030}{}{I've been poisoned!}
{4040}{}{What do you know about Radscorpions?}
{4050}{}{I have a sample of the Radscorpion poison, can you do 
something with it?}
{4060}{}{Hello again. Just stopping by.}
{5000}{}{What do you want to know about?}
{5010}{}{Garl}
{5020}{}{Junktown}
{5030}{}{Hub}
{5040}{}{Aradesh}
{5050}{}{Tandi}
{5060}{}{Seth}
{5070}{}{Razlo}
{5080}{}{Shady Sands}
{5090}{}{Hello again. Just stopping by.}
{6000}{}{I think I can cure what ails ya. It's gonna cost you @lex price@$ bucks.}
{6010}{}{Well... all right. That sounds fair.}
{6020}{}{Changed my mind. I'll be back later.}
{7000}{}{That should do it. Good luck, youngster.}
{7010}{}{[End.]}
{8000}{}{Sure, sure... We can already arrange something, I guess. But I would like to have something in return, a kind of compensation for my time and work. It's not that I'm trying to earn something out of this, but a help from a colleague like you would be quite appreciated. I'll keep it short then -- I would need $1500 for a short lesson or $3000 for one with more detail. Please, let me know when you have it.}
{8010}{}{You don't have to worry, my appreciated colleague, I have $1500 right here! [You give him $1500]}
{8020}{}{Well, I should start gathering some healing herbs then. See you later, doctor!}
{9000}{}{It was nice seeing you again. Have a good day.}
{9010}{}{[End.]}
{10000}{}{It's late. Come back in the morning.}
{10010}{}{But I need your help.}
{10020}{}{Hnn.}
{11000}{}{Hnn?! What is that? Great, I get awakened by the great mumbling beast of the north. Come back in the morning.}
{11010}{}{[End.]}
{12000}{}{Sure, about what?}
{12010}{}{What do you know about Radscorpions?}
{12020}{}{Nothing at all.}
{13000}{}{Not too much. They seem to be extremely large versions
of the north American Emperor scorpion. Contrary to my
medical knowledge, their poison has grown more potent,
not diluted, as I would expect. Seth has been hunting them,
which helps some of my tests.}
{13010}{}{[More...]}
{13020}{}{You seem well educated. What are you doing here?}
{14000}{}{And how such a large creature can even be possible by natural evolution, or even radiation induced mutation is beyond me.}
{14010}{}{I need something for their poison.}
{14020}{}{Thanks}
{14030}{}{[More..]}
{15000}{}{Doc Morbid in Junktown taught me some. And just because we live in stone huts, does not mean we are less intelligent or educated. Have a nice day.}
{15010}{}{[Exit.]}
{16000}{}{If I had a sample of their poison, I could create a cure.}
{16010}{}{I will find a sample.}
{17000}{}{Here, let's see.}
{17010}{}{[Next...]}
{18000}{}{Yep, just as I thought. Let me get the cure.}
{18010}{}{[Next...]}
{19000}{}{You seem fine, now. Be careful in the future.}
{19010}{}{[End.]}
{20000}{}{They seem to be sensitive to light. Nocturnal. If I
could get a sample of their poison, especially the
venom production sac located in their tail, I could
create an anti-venom.}
{20010}{}{[End.]}
{21000}{}{Here, take this as a free sample. It seems to work
well against radscorpion stings, of course, but it
shows much potential as a general anti-venom and
poison cure.}
{21010}{}{Thank you.}
{22000}{}{Well, I can try to fix you up and cure what ails you, but it's going to cost you $@lex price@. Want me to have at it?}
{22010}{}{Yes, please. Here's your money, Doc.}
{22020}{}{I can't afford that right now. Sorry,maybe another time, when the sun shines brighter, eh?}
{23000}{}{There you go. You're all set.}
{23010}{}{Thanks doctor.}
{24000}{}{Sorry, I can't cure any poisons. I don't have the
 proper ingredients to make a decent anti-venom.}
{24010}{}{Bye.}
{25000}{}{Are you hurt?}
{25010}{}{Yes.}
{25020}{}{No.}
{26000}{}{You will be, if you keep me from my sleep. Now come
 back in the morning.}
{26010}{}{Bye.}
{27000}{}{They are a lawless group who pretend to be some people from the
 far past.}
{27010}{}{Tell me more about...}
{28000}{}{He leads the Khans.  He is one of the most dangerous men that
 has ever set eyes on Shady Sands.  He leads the raider clans with a heavy fist.}
{28010}{}{Tell me more about...}
{29000}{}{It's 4-6 days to the southwest.  Good trading occasionally, but
 more often than not, they try to stiff us.}
{29010}{}{Tell me more about...}
{30000}{}{You're standing in it.}
{30010}{}{Tell me more about...}
{31000}{}{Much farther to the south than Junktown.  The Hub is the largest
 city I've heard about.  Must be a thousand people there, at least.}
{31010}{}{Tell me more about...}
{32000}{}{She is the daughter of Aradesh.  Some day she could lead us, but
 she must learn to temper her ways.}
{32010}{}{Tell me more about...}
{33000}{}{He is the leader of our community, and a true hero.  You can always find him at work in the communal hall.}
{33010}{}{Tell me more about...}
{34000}{}{He works with Aradesh to make sure we are safe.}
{34010}{}{Tell me more about...}
{35000}{}{That is me. I am the doctor for Shady Sands.}
{35010}{}{Tell me more about...}
{36000}{}{error}
{37000}{}{error}
{38000}{}{Hmm, Tandi is gone? I find this hard to believe, but maybe
 she ran away with Seth. I know that they have been eyeing
 each other lately. Aradesh was always a little bit of a
 prude, perhaps it was too much for her finally.}
{38010}{}{Bye.}
{100000001}{}{Please do not take my things.}
{100000002}{}{You gain 250 experience points for helping make the antidote.}

